# Supabase PostgreSQL Database Configuration
# Obtain your URI from Supabase: Project Settings -> Database -> Connection string -> URI
# Format (Session / Transaction Pooler - Port 6543 or 5432):
# postgresql+psycopg2://postgres.[PROJECT_REF]:[YOUR_PASSWORD]@aws-0-[REGION].pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres
DATABASE_URL=postgresql+psycopg2://postgres.yourprojectref:yourpassword@aws-0-eu-central-1.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres
